       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-NESTED-VM.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-NESTED-VM-PROOFS.
           05  WS-NESTING-DEPTH-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ISOLATION-FIDELITY-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LYAPUNOV-DECAY-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-INTER-TIER-COMMUTE-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-NESTED-VM-SEAL-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-NESTED-VM-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-NESTED-PROVEN        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-NESTED-CODE        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-DEPTH-AND-ISOLATION.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-LYAPUNOV-AND-COMMUTE.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-NESTED-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-DEPTH-AND-ISOLATION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-NESTING-DEPTH-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ISOLATION-FIDELITY-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-LYAPUNOV-AND-COMMUTE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LYAPUNOV-DECAY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-INTER-TIER-COMMUTE-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-NESTED-PROOFS.
           IF WS-NESTING-DEPTH-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ISOLATION-FIDELITY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-LYAPUNOV-DECAY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-INTER-TIER-COMMUTE-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-NESTED-VM-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-NESTED-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-NESTED-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-NESTED-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-NESTED-CODE.
